2:T538,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Should I invest in Shopify theme design and customization from scratch or transform an existing theme?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Shopify theme design and customization from scratch gives you maximum speed, differentiation and long-term flexibility. Expert Shopify theme design and customization of a premium theme delivers excellent results at lower cost for most brands. A premium theme customized well can produce excellent results for most brands at lower cost. A fully custom theme gives you more speed, differentiation and long-term flexibility. We'll give you an honest recommendation after understanding your needs."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can you customize any Shopify theme?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"We work with all major Shopify themes — Dawn, Debut, Prestige, Impulse, Turbo and more. We can also customize themes built by other developers after a codebase review."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Will theme changes affect my SEO?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Done correctly, theme customization improves SEO — cleaner code, better performance and correct semantic structure all benefit rankings. We always audit SEO impact as part of any significant theme change."}}]}0:{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Service\",\"name\":\"Shopify Theme Design & Customization\",\"description\":\"Custom Shopify theme design and expert theme customization. Whether building from scratch or transforming an existing theme — we make your Shopify store look and perform exactly how your brand demands.\",\"provider\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Agentix\",\"url\":\"https://agentixmarketing.com\"},\"areaServed\":\"US\",\"url\":\"https://agentixmarketing.com/services/theme-design-customization\"}"}}]